  "description": "Retro-Inspired Single-Speed Beach Cruiser Bike with 140H Rims for Ultimate Style\n\nFeaturing an iconic lowrider bike frame and springer fork.\nVintage details include high-rise ape handlebars, banana seat, and sissy bar for that boss '70's look.\nSingle speed drivetrain is easy to use and maintain. Rear coaster brake provides intuitive stopping.\n20” wheel features real fat tire. Lightweight aluminum rims. Fenders look great and help protect you from splashes.\nFits riders age 6 and up.\n\nCOLORS\n\nFRAME\n\nTracer Hi-ten steel Classical\n\nFORK\n\nTracer Steel 22.2*25.4*140mm\n\nSHOCK\n\nN/A\n\nHANDLEBAR\n\nTracer Steel Hi-Rise 650*300*22.2*1.4T\n\nSTEM\n\nAlloy 22.2*25.4*180mm Heavy Duty\n\nHEADSET\n\nSteel Diameter 1\"*22.2*30*27mm, H=34mm\n\nSEATPOST\n\nSteel 22.2*250L*1.4T\n\nSADDLE\n\nVacuum elastic PVC leather+high density PU foam with springs\n\nCRANKSET\n\nAlloy/steel, Crank Arm Length:127mm in Teeth Count:46T\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\n\nKY-001\n\nRIMS\n\n20*14G*140H\n\nFRONT HUB\n\nSF-HB27F,3/8\"*14G*140H*100*150mm\n\nREAR HUB\n\nKT-305RD,3/8\"*14G*140H*110*150mm\n\nSPOKES\n\n14gauge steel Black\n\nTIRES\n\n20*2.125\"\n\nFENDERS\n\nWide:68mm, Height:25mm, Thickness:0.5mm\n\nEXTRAS\n\nN/A\n\nWEIGHT\n\nThe most accurate way to determine any bike’s weight is to have your local dealer weigh it for you. Many brands strive to list the lowest possible weight, but in reality weight can vary based on size, finish, hardware and accessories. All our bikes are designed for best-in-class weight and ride quality.",
